    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Paris Class Steamknight</h2><p>Speed is war: strike hard, strike fast, get out even faster.</p>\n<p><strong>High-Speed Strike:</strong> move up to 20 ft and make a 1d10 slashing attack.</p>\n<p><strong>Burst Fire:</strong> three 1d6 piercing attacks.</p>\n<p><strong>Jet Dash:</strong> Bonus Action, move up to 20 ft.</p>\n<p><strong>Drive-By Attack:</strong> move up to 20 ft and make a 1d8 piercing attack during movement; does not provoke from the attacked target.</p>\n<p><strong>Disengage Burst:</strong> after attacking, Bonus Action move 15 ft without opportunity attacks from the creature attacked.</p>\n<p><strong>Alpha Strike:</strong> after moving at least 20 ft this turn, deal 2d10 slashing + 1d8 piercing.</p>\n<p><em>Movement and movement prerequisites are manual riders.</em></p>",
      "chat": "<p></p>"
    },
